                        ],
                        "form": "splatterdashed"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "33f187d9-7c45-454d-bee9-db7df40e74fc",
                        "entry_id": "16829c9a-0476-36ff-bc6f-aac4c0f389bc",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "splatterdashed"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7e634734-0232-37ad-8898-03a3c2cf8102",
                        "entry_id": "16829c9a-0476-36ff-bc6f-aac4c0f389bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To apply a splatterdash coat."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15476442-ac13-41e1-ae25-105ffc35b43a",
                                "sense_id": "7e634734-0232-37ad-8898-03a3c2cf8102",
                                "text": "Uncle Samuel's house was an old-fashioned one of rough stone, \"splatterdashed\" with fine pebbles on the outside."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c140da2-8fe7-4b34-9cff-9c9bc44148b3",
                                "sense_id": "7e634734-0232-37ad-8898-03a3c2cf8102",
                                "text": "What a cozy little breakfast room — and the wall is so artistically splatterdashed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e020e5e4-732d-4d93-98d3-ee131376f254",
                                "sense_id": "7e634734-0232-37ad-8898-03a3c2cf8102",
                                "text": "Many like to splatterdash the floor of a bed or kitchen, and the process is simple to do."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df5f0cdd-95e5-478b-b7ac-cca0f3b2eef3",
                                "sense_id": "7e634734-0232-37ad-8898-03a3c2cf8102",
                                "text": "Interior walls are plastered, those subject to the most wear being splatterdashed."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eee56354-7316-3b24-a85c-49fa4cd69da8",
                        "entry_id": "16829c9a-0476-36ff-bc6f-aac4c0f389bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To affix splatterdashes to."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a218887-8575-46ef-b7ec-65ade06e76fe",
                                "sense_id": "eee56354-7316-3b24-a85c-49fa4cd69da8",
                                "text": "\"I could splatterdash it for you,\" she said. \"We used to wear daub-stick cottons when I was a girl, and we thought them pretty fine.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b4295bc-a625-3fc4-a644-062e70f34a4f",
                        "entry_id": "16829c9a-0476-36ff-bc6f-aac4c0f389bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To splash violently; to splatter with water and/or mud."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "64bc953e-2d14-43ab-9fff-bf26926bc541",
                                "sense_id": "7b4295bc-a625-3fc4-a644-062e70f34a4f",
                                "text": "How he found himself stepping up when he was told to step down, down when he was told to step up; how he passed through a long box against a cold sponge splatterdashed in his face; how he opened his astonished eyes to see the knife of the guillotine descending on his innocent neck; how he was tossed up and down in the cruel blanket, until brains and bowels were both \"discombobulated,\" and he felt more than ever like a \"cat in a strange garret.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16857392-d2d1-48e7-9f0e-baed9e6f96c3",
                                "sense_id": "7b4295bc-a625-3fc4-a644-062e70f34a4f",
                                "text": "“Dat frisky li'l nigger suah will be splatterdashed ef he fall offen dat mule's back !” And indeed it did look bad for the small colored boy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ae9fd2f-a0bb-4a64-a99a-0c09dfc0aada",
                                "sense_id": "7b4295bc-a625-3fc4-a644-062e70f34a4f",
                                "text": "He was turning around and splashing and splatterdashing with intense spizzerinktum —which is the over-mastering will to succeed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d55e4baf-9043-4d37-8cf1-7ed67f053a3c",
                                "sense_id": "7b4295bc-a625-3fc4-a644-062e70f34a4f",
                                "text": "Splatterdashing pearls of spring rain carelessly aimed multiple minor blows all over the above Raman passerby's body."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
